            <div xml:id="m-2da71624-bbba-4f6e-9c02-ca40b3317319">
              <lg xml:id="m-b9cde945-ed7f-484b-8e66-fc7c123a12a6">
                <l xml:id="m-d469e05f-9e99-46b3-8e0f-0efc124392cb" facs="#m-9fbac8cf-301a-43eb-b99c-9f1d667ae73f" label="ambiguous">1202</l><l xml:id="m-81c5d7d1-0683-4dc9-9a3c-f647c2f7ea17" facs="#m-95450dea-b784-4f1e-a054-ca5af4827782" label="text-like">Mass for the Propagation of the Faith.</l><l xml:id="m-a17db417-d39a-4049-98f4-01472258e5ec" facs="#m-8d62a4d4-5ff2-4a03-a55f-cf43961fd9c9" label="lyrics-like">ctárum permáneat feminárum: sit rábilis, doctrinis caeléstibus erudita:</l><l xml:id="m-37332c5a-5f98-4e02-bb83-2667d9b4eb3f" facs="#m-de8c7e04-a0d6-4268-b681-541b1fc8981e" label="lyrics-like">sit foecúnda in sóbole, sit probáta</l><l xml:id="m-83afc99c-6634-43dc-88bb-7d9932f777be" facs="#m-018f1b53-b010-48a2-9f40-8a1fa385943d" label="lyrics-like">amábilis viro suo, ut Rachel: sá¬</l><l xml:id="m-ba5b4a68-4e60-4c58-9f53-f35913caeb8e" facs="#m-1a505641-23ba-43b8-8b58-4258051e4612" label="lyrics-like">piens, ut Rebécca: longaéva et</l><l xml:id="m-65ed7d2b-d076-42bf-8d6b-9ce3cd1ae3c3" facs="#m-9a6a300b-11e7-434c-a431-81fe8c8bd9b4" label="lyrics-like">et innocens: et ad beatórum ré¬</l><l xml:id="m-9437511a-5191-4732-94da-fe6cd3551dbb" facs="#m-2e8d50ad-d75e-446f-a40f-cb6946600237" label="lyrics-like">fidélis, ut Sara: nihil in ea ex ácti¬</l><l xml:id="m-441162d7-1afb-44c9-848b-64a6bcd280a5" facs="#m-3cab3cf0-38f1-4a0f-82ae-895555c61561" label="lyrics-like">quiem atque ad caeléstia regna per¬</l><l xml:id="m-3362a316-eff3-4701-bc49-45102b8bd723" facs="#m-cc865a5e-8990-4de6-8c27-8355999de246" label="lyrics-like">véniat: et videant ambo filios filió¬</l><l xml:id="m-6bd00bf3-e87e-47ac-880f-b3cfedae59ad" facs="#m-454a2d13-6e69-40bd-a8dd-95309edbe49b" label="lyrics-like">bus suis ille auctor praevaricatiónis</l><l xml:id="m-04a980fb-61f6-4243-a423-f0213e344216" facs="#m-3de5cf8d-eeba-4003-bde4-303dec887af9" label="lyrics-like">rum suórum usque in tértiam et</l><l xml:id="m-09ad7831-71c1-45b5-b6d0-576de9588274" facs="#m-8e8f3bbe-9e70-40b9-b6ad-d9c355d31de1" label="lyrics-like">usúrpet: nexa fidei, mandatisque</l><l xml:id="m-408c2df3-8ba2-455a-bd54-8fbe20714745" facs="#m-b89e2eff-5f61-4d6a-8a7c-b7e7f2267ef5" label="lyrics-like">quartam generatiónem, et ad optá¬</l><l xml:id="m-86787c6e-656f-463f-9ebb-99909cdc91f2" facs="#m-2dac5b07-a1eb-44ed-9ceb-3485c211b222" label="lyrics-like">permáneat: uni thoro juncta, con¬</l><l xml:id="m-1f7217cb-5bf9-496b-87c8-a3c073626958" facs="#m-39754da3-c7dc-4bfa-a0d0-e7421b8d82b6" label="lyrics-like">táctus illicitos fúgiat: múniat infir-tam pervéniant senectútem. Per</l><l xml:id="m-588df90b-265b-46e8-96ec-c1241173c397" facs="#m-92c65977-bf25-4326-9378-ce749b139e1e" label="lyrics-like">mitátem suam róbore disciplinae: eúmdem Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-6b98fce1-20b2-4705-ab58-71a04cc186d6" facs="#m-ac188b52-9629-4c3a-a16a-61327f3c4658" label="lyrics-like">sit verecúndia gravis, pudóre vene¬</l><l xml:id="m-00e2de94-368b-4b3c-a901-ecc78cc25d64" facs="#m-ed00183a-c083-40be-8dc6-2c0438d27be8" label="ambiguous">comm.E</l><l xml:id="m-1ab40320-9c53-43ce-88a1-d1abc2ecd2e4" facs="#m-a4e0f4ac-9630-43cb-9fc0-49a4ad7e1cb2" label="ambiguous">6.</l><l xml:id="m-a3258c36-20a0-4511-9d08-c0e772867010" facs="#m-55959541-0301-497d-8999-e4a885dd0da8" label="lyrics-like">Cce sic be-nedi-cétur “ ómnis hó-mo qui tímet</l><l xml:id="m-c4ebf624-dce8-4c04-a340-218ca9db7815" facs="#m-cd7244d4-0a23-4959-b63c-d218fb350f66" label="lyrics-like">Dómi- num: et ví- de-as fí-li-os fi-li-6́-rum tu-ó¬</l><l xml:id="m-6eb8ed4b-e6a4-41a8-ae43-8fd165153880" facs="#m-81d54a22-fd59-41fc-9bcf-aa63a192d02f" label="lyrics-like">Isra¬ el. T. P. Alle-lú¬ ia.</l><l xml:id="m-f7723289-2278-4c92-a832-dce69ba6b83b" facs="#m-5326618d-e82e-4708-9dd7-e51980cf7445" label="ambiguous">rum: pax su-per</l><l xml:id="m-5dd7c801-17b3-4b2a-ad10-60a38c6afdbf" facs="#m-9b7d58f2-d9a7-4c13-b3e1-48d33421cf0e" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-b3857df4-8e58-46a0-96fd-edd281504e0b" facs="#m-7bfdba37-700c-456d-a64d-7e1155b37639" label="lyrics-like">Uaésumus, omnípotens Deus: societâte connéctis, longaéva pace</l><l xml:id="m-08b87ba4-34e8-4b6e-9ed9-49ca9f9ecc6e" facs="#m-44e88489-10d1-4c88-9b91-b44f9994c5ac" label="lyrics-like">U institúta providéntiae tuae pio l custódias. Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-224fa12c-6be0-46ed-91ba-db8a945f45ba" facs="#m-0bb9a798-c61c-4191-8a66-6520b29bc595" label="lyrics-like">favóre comitâre: ut quos legitima!</l><l xml:id="m-ba68024d-939d-46d8-b71a-e1540985fefe" facs="#m-5f68d9f8-3141-4659-adc9-c4e03e0b1927" label="lyrics-like">T Arter the Benedicámus Dómino. or after the Ite missa est. according to the</l><l xml:id="m-a0865285-d009-4a58-b6be-2acbb8e14895" facs="#m-2bb515f0-5baf-4fb0-93d5-e3ed4093a551" label="text-like">rubrics of the day. the Priest, before giving the blessing to the faithful, turns</l><l xml:id="m-c4a69324-0602-4521-be94-e8bbb4e36c9a" facs="#m-22b16703-676c-41f5-b97f-0fc80d96bd50" label="text-like">towards the Bride and Bridegroom and says:</l><l xml:id="m-7689eef6-f4e9-450b-9f8c-7650a5d5d029" facs="#m-8ebc822c-a632-406f-b964-2bba20bb2a1a" label="lyrics-like">Eus Abraham, Deus Isaac, et  aetérnam habeátis sine fine: adiu¬</l><l xml:id="m-66e6632c-9a86-417a-9002-bc867291ad22" facs="#m-885ec4c9-40bf-4fae-bea6-db715751ba15" label="ambiguous">O Deus Jacob sit vobiscum: et</l><l xml:id="m-8813975d-5ab7-4d01-8ac3-ace3e3f599f9" facs="#m-23263247-ff73-4642-a1b5-1f720e3ab3ae" label="lyrics-like">vánte Dómino nostro Jesu Christo,</l><l xml:id="m-47ad1a8a-3ac1-4ee7-bb82-c5445f79d97d" facs="#m-55fbaced-0da7-42d2-aca7-2a124989af8b" label="ambiguous">qui cum Patre et Spiritu Sancto vi¬</l><l xml:id="m-f5defdd8-0ac9-4d9e-a396-51a99505b8dc" facs="#m-5b8a0f86-c790-461d-932c-dcfa017266c3" label="lyrics-like">ipse adimpleat benedictiónem suam</l><l xml:id="m-2afad7fc-0e9d-47e1-9d66-6285b897a734" facs="#m-8bdd2e87-2d8d-4b2b-8569-a4e52458f731" label="lyrics-like">in vobis: ut videátis filios filiórum</l><l xml:id="m-ecca5278-15c6-47a5-8b24-a87303718229" facs="#m-1b666434-000a-4455-ace3-c9cc02f36e50" label="lyrics-like">vit et regnat Deus, per ómnia saé¬</l><l xml:id="m-dd00fe49-3153-4690-8865-2586c74b02eb" facs="#m-7f1cc0b2-37c1-4295-8ee9-c6133a9a3c31" label="lyrics-like">vestrórum usque ad tértiam et quar¬</l><l xml:id="m-85abc6e0-de13-4166-ba7e-7bf96ab5b59c" facs="#m-95a8b22d-fe96-473a-9eb7-fb3b152f8450" label="lyrics-like">cula saeculórum. H. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-c25ccd24-28d2-440e-849a-343cb6f97295" facs="#m-6890faeb-63b7-4f0e-9f5b-6a5691cbccce" label="lyrics-like">tam generatiónem : et póstea vitam</l><l xml:id="m-bf61c8a6-d61f-4587-b9f9-63ee62a7b3dd" facs="#m-e7842f89-17c9-4e31-94da-53de61639303" label="text-like">Mass for the Propagation of the Faith.</l><l xml:id="m-dcc4f81f-56b3-4278-b18e-9a4c2ba6fdfd" facs="#m-bd8ac3c5-5a4d-41db-a05a-80808b38f3d6" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-6e7f8559-b8a7-4cf6-bc8a-35057d6b9fae" facs="#m-9942e5b7-09d2-4c78-b82c-0487cccbe4d8" label="ambiguous">3.</l><l xml:id="m-d11efd8e-7768-4996-8ccd-6eca29e17462" facs="#m-665d5616-86a8-4208-a954-da85ebc69f20" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-caaceb11-18e8-4c85-bfd9-5c33a833373d" facs="#m-4535b95d-cba3-4fff-9f93-3b4d4ca34b9e" label="lyrics-like">E-us" mi-sere-átur nó-stri, et benedí¬ cat nó¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
